  "mechanism": "inotify_add_watch accepts IN_MOVED_FROM and IN_MOVED_TO, but the rename path (sys_renameat2, Path::rename, DirDentry::rename) never calls into fs::vfs::notify, and InotifyFile::receive_event always queues cookie 0, so a watched directory sees no move pair for a rename.",
  "sites": [
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/inotify.rs::parse_inotify_watch_request",
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/rename.rs::sys_renameat2",
    "kernel/core/src/fs/vfs/path/dentry.rs::DirDentry::rename",
    "kernel/core/src/fs/vfs/notify/inotify.rs::InotifyFile::receive_event"
  ],
