  "contract": "inotify(7): a rename inside a watched directory generates IN_MOVED_FROM and IN_MOVED_TO, linked by the same nonzero cookie.",
  "observed": "By source reading at the pin (not run): no IN_MOVED_FROM or IN_MOVED_TO event is queued, and any queued event carries cookie 0.",
